---
title: "What's My Mortgage.ca — Ontario Mortgage Calculators"
description: "See what you can afford, what your renewal really costs, or what breaking your mortgage would mean — free Ontario calculators, real lender math, no signup."
canonicalPath: "/"
ogSlug: "home"
pageScript: "/assets/js/pages/home.js"
layout: layouts/base.njk
schema:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "WebSite"
  name: "What's My Mortgage.ca"
  url: "https://whatsmymortgage.ca/"
  description: "Free mortgage calculators for Ontario, worked out with the same math a lender uses."
---
<div class="hero container-mid">
  <h1>What's my mortgage?</h1>
  <p>Answers about buying, renewing, refinancing, or renting, worked out with the same math a lender uses. Tap the <span class="info-dot">i</span> beside any term you don't recognize.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--space-3);margin-top:var(--space-6)">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/mortgage-affordability-calculator/">See what you can afford</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/learn/">Start from the beginning</a>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:var(--space-6)">
    {% for b in copy.TRUST_BADGES %}<span class="tag tag-outline">{{ b }}</span>{% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section-shaded">
  <div class="section container">
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Where are you right now?</h2>
    <p style="font-size:14px;opacity:.65;margin:0 0 var(--space-4);max-width:56ch">Pick the sentence closest to your situation. It opens the right calculator and the right reading.</p>
    <div class="grid-auto">
      <div class="card elev-sm" style="padding:var(--space-4)">
        <a href="/mortgage-affordability-calculator/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px">I'm thinking about buying</div>
          <p class="card-body" style="margin:0">See what you could realistically afford.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/learn/what-a-mortgage-actually-is/" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--font-heading)">Or read the basics first →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card elev-sm" style="padding:var(--space-4)">
        <a href="/mortgage-renewal-calculator/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px">My mortgage is renewing soon</div>
          <p class="card-body" style="margin:0">Check what your bank's offer actually costs.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/learn/term-vs-amortization/" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--font-heading)">Or read about renewals first →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card elev-sm" style="padding:var(--space-4)">
        <a href="/mortgage-refinance-calculator/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px">I'm wondering about refinancing</div>
          <p class="card-body" style="margin:0">See what tapping your equity would free up.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/learn/down-payment-and-loan-to-value/" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--font-heading)">Or read about equity first →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card elev-sm" style="padding:var(--space-4)">
        <a href="/rent-vs-buy-calculator/" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px">I'm renting and not sure</div>
          <p class="card-body" style="margin:0">Compare renting and buying over five years.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/learn/what-a-mortgage-actually-is/" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--font-heading)">Or read the basics first →</a>
      </div>
      <a href="/learn/" class="card elev-sm click-card" style="padding:var(--space-4)">
        <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px">I just want to understand what I have</div>
        <p class="card-body" style="margin:0">Start with the basics, no calculator needed yet.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Ask {{ site.personaName }}</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px;opacity:.65;margin:0 0 var(--space-4);max-width:56ch">{{ site.personaName }} explains anything on this site in plain language, and points you at the right calculator. Available on every page.</p>
      <div class="card elev-sm" style="padding:var(--space-6);background:var(--color-bg)">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--space-2);flex-wrap:wrap">
          <input id="ask-input" class="input" style="flex:1 1 260px" placeholder='Ask a question, like "what is loan-to-value?"'/>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="ask-submit">Ask</button>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:var(--space-4)">
          {% for chip in copy.ASK_CHIPS %}
            {% if chip.jargon %}
            <a class="tag tag-neutral" style="text-decoration:none" href="/mortgage-glossary/#{{ chip.jargon }}">{{ chip.label }}</a>
            {% else %}
            <button type="button" class="tag tag-neutral" style="cursor:pointer;border:none" data-ask-query="{{ chip.query }}">{{ chip.label }}</button>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <p id="ask-error" hidden style="font-size:13px;opacity:.65;margin:var(--space-4) 0 0">{{ site.personaName }} isn't sure about that one yet. Try a calculator from the list below instead.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section container" id="calc-grid">
  <h2 style="margin:0 0 var(--space-4)">Every calculator</h2>
  <div class="grid-auto-lg">
    {% for calc in calculators %}
    <a href="/{{ calc.slug }}/" class="card elev-sm click-card" style="padding:var(--space-4)">
      <span class="calc-glyph">{{ calc.glyph }}</span>
      <div class="card-title">{{ calc.navTitle }}</div>
      <p class="card-body">{{ calc.cardDesc }}</p>
      <div class="calc-open">Open →</div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section-shaded">
  <div class="section container">
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 var(--space-4)">Dig deeper</h2>
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="seg" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-6);display:inline-flex">
        <label class="seg-opt"><input type="radio" name="hometab" id="tab-learn" checked/>Learn</label>
        <label class="seg-opt"><input type="radio" name="hometab" id="tab-process"/>Process</label>
        <label class="seg-opt"><input type="radio" name="hometab" id="tab-rates"/>Rates &amp; mistakes</label>
        <label class="seg-opt"><input type="radio" name="hometab" id="tab-sources"/>Sources &amp; roadmap</label>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel panel-learn">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:var(--space-3);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:var(--space-4)">
          <h3 style="margin:0">Learn the basics</h3>
          <a href="/learn/" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--font-heading)">See everything →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-auto-md" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-6)">
          {% for a in learnArticles %}
          <a href="/learn/{{ a.slug }}/" class="card click-card" style="padding:var(--space-4);border:1px solid var(--color-divider);background:var(--color-bg)">
            <div class="card-title" style="font-size:15px">{{ a.title }}</div>
            <p class="card-body" style="margin:6px 0 0">{{ a.readTime }}</p>
          </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 var(--space-4)">What you'll need</h3>
        <div class="grid-auto-md">
          {% for g in copy.DOC_GROUPS %}
          <div class="card" style="padding:var(--space-4);border:1px solid var(--color-divider);background:var(--color-bg)">
            <div class="card-title" style="font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px">{{ g.title }}</div>
            {% for item in g.items %}<div style="font-size:13px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-divider);opacity:.8">{{ item }}</div>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel panel-process">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 var(--space-2)">What happens next</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14px;opacity:.65;margin:0 0 var(--space-4);max-width:56ch">The actual sequence, start to finish. <a href="/what-happens-next/">Full timeline →</a></p>
        <div class="process-strip">
          {% for step in copy.PROCESS_STEPS %}
          <div class="process-step">
            <div class="process-n">{{ step.n }}</div>
            <div class="process-title">{{ step.title }}</div>
            <p class="process-blurb">{{ step.blurb }}</p>
            <div class="process-timing">{{ step.timing }}</div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel panel-rates">
        <div class="card elev-sm" style="padding:var(--space-6);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--space-4);justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--color-bg);margin-bottom:var(--space-6)">
          <div style="flex:1 1 320px">
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px">Rates, translated</h3>
            <p style="font-size:14px;opacity:.75;margin:0;max-width:56ch">{{ copy.RATE_NOTE }}</p>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:right">
            <div style="font-size:11px;opacity:.5;margin-bottom:4px">Last updated</div>
            <div style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:800;font-size:14px">August 2026</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 var(--space-4)">Common mistakes</h3>
        <div class="grid-auto-md">
          {% for m in copy.MISTAKES %}
          <div class="mistake">
            <div class="mistake-title">{{ m.title }}</div>
            <p class="mistake-body">{{ m.body }}</p>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel panel-sources">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:var(--space-3);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:var(--space-3)">
          <h3 style="margin:0">Built on published sources</h3>
          <a href="/sources/" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--font-heading)">Full methodology →</a>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--space-3);margin-bottom:var(--space-6)">
          {% for src in copy.SOURCE_NAMES %}<span style="font-size:13px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--color-divider);background:var(--color-bg)">{{ src }}</span>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 var(--space-4)">What's live, what's coming</h3>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)">
          {% for r in copy.ROADMAP %}
          <div class="roadmap-row">
            <span>{{ r.label }}</span>
            <span class="tag {{ r.tagClass }}">{{ r.status }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section container-narrow">
  <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Talk to a person</h2>
  <p style="font-size:14px;opacity:.65;margin:0 0 var(--space-4);max-width:56ch">Optional, and separate from every tool on this site. No calculator result ever requires this.</p>
  {{ contactCardHtml({ id: 'home', calculatorName: 'General inquiry' }) | safe }}
</div>
